    {
      "v": "reporter",
      "t": "Спасибо, Аркадий Борисович!",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "So that's Arkady in public: the boy from the communal flat, now a smooth politician who dodges hard questions. Watch for those reporters' questions when you see the episode. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "До свидания!",
      "gap": 0.3
